{"papers":[{"id":"official:1beaefc1bb96929e","title":"Solving math word problems","url":"https://openai.com/index/solving-math-word-problems","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://openai.com/index/solving-math-word-problems"],"alternate_titles":["Solving math word problems"],"published":"2021-10-29","authors":["OpenAI"],"abstract":"We’ve trained a system that solves grade school math problems with nearly twice the accuracy of a fine-tuned GPT-3 model. It solves about 90% as many problems as real kids: a small sample of 9-12 year olds scored 60% on a test from our dataset, while our system scored 55% on those same problems.","companies":["OpenAI"],"matched_orgs":["OpenAI"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"research_post","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":56,"matched_keywords":["Research"],"author_affiliations":["OpenAI"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://openai.com/index/solving-math-word-problems","labs":["OpenAI"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml","matched_terms":["GPT"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"research_post"},"ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},{"id":"apple:sbawlnyjh0wrmxbl183bc806","title":"Randomized Controlled Trials without Data Retention","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/randomized-controlled-trials","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/randomized-controlled-trials"],"alternate_titles":["Randomized Controlled Trials without Data Retention"],"published":"2021-10-25","authors":["Winston Chou"],"abstract":"Amidst rising appreciation for privacy and data usage rights, researchers have increasingly acknowledged the principle of data minimization, which holds that the accessibility, collection, and retention of subjects' data should be kept to the bare amount needed to answer focused research questions. Applying this principle to randomized controlled trials (RCTs), this paper presents algorithms for making accurate inferences from RCTs under...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/randomized-controlled-trials","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:tq6m6xra56m5sjvndmn0pldo","title":"Plan-then-Generate: Controlled Data-to-Text","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/data-to-text","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/data-to-text"],"alternate_titles":["Plan-then-Generate: Controlled Data-to-Text"],"published":"2021-10-25","authors":["Yixuan Su","David Vandyke","Sihui Wang","Yimai Fang","Nigel Collier"],"abstract":"Recent developments in neural networks have led to the advance in data-to-text generation. However, the lack of ability of neural models to control the structure of generated output can be limiting in certain real-world applications. In this study, we propose a novel Plan-then-Generate (PlanGen) framework to improve the controllability of neural data-to-text models. Extensive experiments and analyses are conducted on two benchmark datasets, ToTTo...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/data-to-text","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["text generation","neural networks","neural"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:uvyjexhghqqea2sj1uzmzjyf","title":"Interdependent Variables: Remotely Designing Tactile Graphics for an Accessible Workflow","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/interdependent-variables","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/interdependent-variables"],"alternate_titles":["Interdependent Variables: Remotely Designing Tactile Graphics for an Accessible Workflow"],"published":"2021-10-22","authors":["Lilian de Greef","Dominik Moritz","Cynthia Bennet