n Upadhyay","David Winarsky","Hepeng Zhang"],"abstract":"Recent advances in text-to-speech (TTS) synthesis, such as Tacotron and WaveRNN, have made it possible to construct a fully neural network based TTS system, by coupling the two components together. Such a system is conceptually simple as it only takes grapheme or phoneme input, uses Mel-spectrogram as an intermediate feature, and directly generates speech samples. The system achieves quality equal or close to natural speech. However, the high...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/on-device-neural-speech","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["neural network","speech synthesis","text-to-speech","neural"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:u6qxrfar2ruig0dffkvyxttk","title":"MMIU: Dataset for Visual Intent Understanding in Multimodal Assistants","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/mmiu-visual-intent","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/mmiu-visual-intent"],"alternate_titles":["MMIU: Dataset for Visual Intent Understanding in Multimodal Assistants"],"published":"2021-10-20","authors":["Alkesh Patel","Joel Ruben Antony Moniz","Roman Nguyen","Nicholas Tzou","Hadas Kotek","Vincent Renkens"],"abstract":"In multimodal assistant, where vision is also one of the input modalities, the identification of user intent becomes a challenging task as visual input can influence the outcome. Current digital assistants take spoken input and try to determine the user intent from conversational or device context. So, a dataset, which includes visual input (i.e. images or videos for the corresponding questions targeted for multimodal assistant use cases, is not...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/mmiu-visual-intent","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["multimodal"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:gj03u2q1n8o11l4we14vzwke","title":"Learning Compressible Subspaces for Adaptive Network Compression at Inference Time","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-compressible-subspaces","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-compressible-subspaces"],"alternate_titles":["Learning